            <p class="drop-cap">Taking control of your health in 2026 is more critical than ever. With sedentary lifestyles becoming the norm, highly processed foods dominating supermarket shelves, and stress levels reaching all-time highs, many beginners feel completely overwhelmed when trying to establish a healthy daily routine. The truth is, wellness doesn't require extreme makeovers; it requires small, consistent habits compounded over time.</p>

