            <h2>3. The Secret Power of Hydration</h2>
            <p>Water is the most underrated supplement in the world. Over 70% of the adult population lives in a state of chronic, mild dehydration. This leads to brain fog, fake hunger pangs, and a sluggish metabolism. In 2026, health experts recommend drinking at least half your body weight (in ounces) of water daily. Adding a pinch of high-quality sea salt to your morning water can also replenish essential electrolytes lost during sleep.</p>

